    "body": "## Summary\n\n**ADR-043 — `box-shadow`.** Three commits on one branch, merged only after Commit 2's PNG verification.\n\n**Honest scope**: infrastructure-first cycle. 19 `box-shadow` rules in Wikipedia CSS, but only **1 produces a static first-viewport delta** (1px line under the toolbar container).\n\n## Commits\n\n| # | Scope | Status |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | **Parse + layout fields** (behavior-neutral) | ✅ Green — 551 / 2125 tests pass, +12 new |\n| 2 | **Paint** (visible: toolbar line appears) | ⏳ Pending — PNG verification before merge |\n| 3 | **Docs** (ADR-043 → Implemented) | ⏳ Pending |\n\n## Measurement (Wikipedia CSS, 2026-10-28)\n\n| Type | Count | Renders statically? |\n|---|---|---|\n| `inset 0 0 0 1px` focus rings (`:focus`) | 13 | ❌ Needs state-driven re-layout |\n| `inset 2.75em 0 0` code-line highlights | 2 | ❌ `<pre>` blocks, second-viewport |\n| `box-shadow: none` no-ops | 2 | N/A |\n| `.vector-dropdown-content { 0 2px 6px }` | 1 | ❌ `visibility: hidden` |\n| **`.vector-page-toolbar-container { 0 1px #c8ccd1 }`** | **1** | ✅ First-viewport, non-inset |\n\n**Section G of the pre-patch diagnostic confirmed**: toolbar has only the `box-shadow` rule, **no `border-bottom`** — the shadow IS the drawing, so the visible delta is 1px.\n\n## What shipped (Commit 1)\n\n- `LayoutBox` gains 7 fields: `box_shadow_ox/oy/blur/spread`, `box_shadow_color`, `box_shadow_inset`, `box_shadow_has`\n- `box-shadow` shorthand parsed in `layout_element`:\n  - `none` → clear fields\n  - `[inset] <ox> <oy> [blur] [spread] <color>` — 2-4 lengths + color\n  - Multi-shadow (comma) → first only (deferred)\n  - Length validation: numeric prefix + unit, or exact \"0\"\n  - Malformed → drops rule (`foo bar baz`, `1px` alone)\n- **Zero paint changes** — no visible delta\n\n## Deferred (per ADR-043)\n\n- **`inset` render** — 13 rules, all `:focus` state. Needs layout recalc on state change (ADR-018 state is paint-only)\n- **Blur > 0 render** — 1 rule, `visibility: hidden`\n- **Multi-shadow** — 3 rules, all `:focus` state\n- Transitions, percentages, inline-element shadows\n\n## Commit 2 preview (visible delta)\n\n`paint_box` draws shadow before background fill (correct CSS z-order). Non-inset, non-blurred only. ~10 lines in `paint.cpp`.\n\n**PNG verification gate**: `.vector-page-toolbar-container` gains 1px gray line (line under Article/Talk/Read tabs). No unintended shadow artifacts elsewhere.\n\n## Test count\n\n- Before ADR-043: 539 cases / 2064 assertions\n- After Commit 1: **551 cases / 2125 assertions** (+12 / +61)\n\n## Reviewer checklist\n\n- [ ] **Infrastructure-first framing is honest** — 1px visible delta, full box-shadow pipeline shipped. Same pattern as ADR-041 Commit 1 (parse+cascade, 0 delta). Agree?\n- [ ] **Parse-but-skip for inset/blur** — parsed and stored, not rendered. Preserves the chain for future paint-only implementation. Alternative (reject at parse) requires re-parsing. Agree?\n- [ ] **Length-token validation** — `is_length_token` rejects `solid`, `auto`, etc. so `box-shadow: 1px solid red` correctly drops the rule (CSS uses no style keyword in box-shadow; `1px solid red` is malformed). Agree?\n- [ ] **PNG verification gates merge** — Commit 2 must show toolbar line OR honestly record 0 visible delta if the line already exists for another reason.\n\n## DO NOT MERGE until Commit 2's PNG verification passes.\n\nRefs #212",
